ont-size:19px;\">910<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">${q:\/\/QID139\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">${e:\/\/Field\/TimeOnQuestion3.3}<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">3.4) ${q:\/\/QID140\/QuestionText}<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">2820000<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">${q:\/\/QID140\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">${e:\/\/Field\/TimeOnQuestion3.4}<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">3.5) ${q:\/\/QID141\/QuestionText}<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">90366<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">${q:\/\/QID141\/ChoiceTextEntryValue}<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">${e:\/\/Field\/TimeOnQuestion3.5}<\/span><\/p>\n\t\t\t<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:11px;\"><em>\"Your Answer\" of 0 indicates that no answer was submitted within the time limit.<\/em><\/span>","QuestionJS":false,"DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"feedback","QuestionID":"QID111","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline"},"QuestionDescription":"Feedback Table Total Score: ${gr:\/\/SC_ehBDTCVctdnz22a\/Score} \/ 16 \u00a0 Question Correct Answer Your...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_emk6lgDslmVI5bE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID112","SecondaryAttribute":"A few weeks ago, some participants completed several numerical quizzes under varying time limits...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"A few weeks ago, some participants completed several numerical quizzes under <strong>varying time limits (either 40 seconds or 20 seconds)<\/strong> similar to the quizzes you have just done.<br>\n<br>\nThey were instructed to only use mental calculation, and they were also monitored in-person, so you can be sure that they did not use any other calculation tools, including pen and paper. We marked their accuracy.<br>\n<br>\nYour task today will be to guess, for<strong> <\/strong>five of these participants, <strong>which questions they answered correctly in the first quiz where they had a 40 second time limit.<\/strong> To help you, for each participant we will tell you one question that they got right or wrong in another quiz and the time limit for this question.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"A few weeks ago, some participants completed several numerical quizzes under varying time limits...","Choices":[],"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You will be shown 16 numerical (addition) questions, one at a time. The task is to answer the questions accurately, and as fast as you can. After typing in your answer, please click Submit as quickly as possible so that we can record your time. <br><br>After 30 seconds, if you have not submitted an answer, you will automatically proceed to the next question. A message will pop up when 15 seconds have passed, and when you only have 5 seconds left. <br><br>Your compensation does not depend on whether you get the questions right or wrong, or on how fast you answer. <br><br>The task is to find the correct answer on your own, without the aid of any calculation tools (including writing it down, please stick to mental calculations).\n<br><br>As soon as you proceed to the next page, your time for the first question will start.\n<br>","DataExportTag":"instructions_1 ","QuestionID":"QID112","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n    \/\/ Clear any leftover timers from previous quiz questions\n    Object.keys(window).forEach(function(key) {\n        if (key.startsWith(\"__timers_q\")) {\n            try { window[key].forEach(clearTimeout); } catch(e) {}\n            window[key] = [];\n        }\n    });\n});"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_emk6lgDslmVI5bE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID114","SecondaryAttribute":"For the sake of good science, it is very important that we have data that truly reflects human ab...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"For the sake of good science, it is very important that we have data that truly reflects human abilities at mental calculation. <br>If you used AI, a calculator, or even pen and paper to answer the numerical questions, please simply indicate below. <br>We assure you that there will be no consequences for your answer, and you will still receive full compensation. Please be honest.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"used_calculator\u00a0","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For the sake of good science, it is very important that we have data that truly reflects human ab...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I used external calculation tools such as a calculator, pen and paper, or AI to answer (one or more) of the numerical questions. I will not face any consequences for saying so."},"2":{"Display":"I did NOT use any external calculation tools. All of the answers I provided were completely reached through mental calculation."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID114","RecodeValues":{"1":"1","2":"0"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_emk6lgDslmVI5bE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID116","SecondaryAttribute":"Participant ${lm:\/\/Field\/5} had a ${lm:\/\/Field\/6} second time limit to answer the following quest...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Participant ${lm:\/\/Field\/5} had a <strong>${lm:\/\/Field\/6} second<\/strong> time limit to answer the following question, and we recorded that they got it&nbsp;<strong>${lm:\/\/Field\/3}<\/strong>:<br>\n<strong>${lm:\/\/Field\/2}<\/strong> ${lm:\/\/Field\/4}<br>\n<br>\nAccording to you, which of the questions below was Participant ${lm:\/\/Field\/5} able to answer correctly within a<strong>&nbsp;40 second<\/strong> time limit?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"judgement_matrix","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","MobileFirst":true,"ChoiceColumnWidthPixels":335,"WhiteSpace":"OFF"},"QuestionDescription":"Participant ${lm:\/\/Field\/5} had a ${lm:\/\/Field\/6} second time limit to answer the following quest...","Choices":[],"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","MinChoices":"1"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":3,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"<strong><span style=\"font-size:19px;\">Right<\/span><\/strong>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><strong>Wrong<\/strong><\/span>"}},"AnswerOrder":[1,2],"ChoiceDataExportTags":{"x1":"judgement_matrix_x1","x2":"judgement_matrix_x2","x3":"judgement_matrix_x3","x4":"judgement_matrix_x4","x5":"judgement_matrix_x5"},"QuestionID":"QID116","DynamicChoicesData":[],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"ConsistentScaleReversal":false,"EvenPresentation":false,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"None"},"AnswerColumns":2,"SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function() {\n    var qid = this.questionId;\n    var lmField2 = \"${lm:\/\/Field\/2}\";\n    var lmField3 = \"${lm:\/\/Field\/3}\";\n    var targetColumn = lmField3.toLowerCase();\n\n    var columnMap = {\n        \"right\": 1, \n        \"wrong\": 2  \n    };\n\n    var columnRecodeValue = columnMap[targetColumn];\n\n    if (!columnRecodeValue) {\n        console.log(\"Error: Column Recode Value not found or invalid Field 3:\", lmField3);\n        return;\n    }\n\n    var foundMatch = false;\n\n    jQuery('#' + qid + ' .ChoiceRow').each(function(index) {\n        var statementLabelElement = jQuery(this).find('th label');\n\n        var statementText = statementLabelElement.text().trim();\n\n        var cleanLmField2 = lmField2.trim(); \n\n        if (statementText === cleanLmField2) {\n            console.log(\"Match Found! Statement Text == LM Field 2\");\n            foundMatch = true;\n\n            \/\/ Find the radio button for the matched statement and the target column\n            var radioSelector = 'input[type=\"radio\"][value=\"' + columnRecodeValue + '\"]';\n            var radioButton = jQuery(this).find('td ' + radioSelector);\n\n            if (radioButton.length > 0) {\n                radioButton.prop('checked', true);\n                console.log(\"Radio button checked successfully!\");\n            } \n\n            }\n\n    });\n\n    if (!foundMatch) {\n        console.log(\"No matching statement found for Loop & Merge Field 2:\", lmField2);\n    }\n    console.log(\"--- End Script Debug ---\");\n});","RecodeValues":{"1":"1","2":"0"},"ColumnLabels":[{"Display":"I predict that the participant got this question...","IsLabelDefault":false}],"VariableNaming":{"1":"Right","2":"Wrong"},"DynamicChoices":{"DynamicType":"ChoiceGroup","Locator":"